      "start_seconds": 1.1,
      "end_seconds": 3.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "morning, come on through"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.11,
      "end_seconds": 6.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Evening, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.48,
      "end_seconds": 10.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Alright, tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.59,
      "end_seconds": 23.58,
      "duration_seconds": 10.99,
      "text": "Mainly a high sugar test in pregnancy. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.73,
      "end_seconds": 28.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.01,
      "end_seconds": 33.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Since Friday, that's when it began"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.31,
      "end_seconds": 37.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.67,
      "end_seconds": 53.43,
      "duration_seconds": 14.76,
      "text": "Okay, so about a five out of ten. Oh, um, and there's a big baby on the scan as well, ten days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.12,
      "end_seconds": 65.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.56,
      "end_seconds": 79.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.52,
      "end_seconds": 111.59,
      "duration_seconds": 10.07,
      "text": "okay: heart rate 75, height 151 centimetres, BMI works out to 30.3, blood pressure 108 over 79, weight 69 kilos, temperature 36.4."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.6,
      "end_seconds": 116.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.84,
      "end_seconds": 120.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "I'll come back to the the numbers"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.55,
      "end_seconds": 125.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "let me look at the the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.84,
      "end_seconds": 129.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.74,
      "end_seconds": 150.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.72,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal and your urine has no sugar today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.31,
      "end_seconds": 160.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "you can sit up now any thirst passing a lot of urine or blurred vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.93,
      "end_seconds": 166.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Erm, no, nothing to to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.96,
      "end_seconds": 172.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "have you had reduced baby movements by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.32,
      "end_seconds": 177.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Right, no, none, no reduced baby movements."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.73,
      "end_seconds": 180.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "So, neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.07,
      "end_seconds": 187.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "nothing odd there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.7,
      "end_seconds": 192.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "how are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.96,
      "end_seconds": 199.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, I move fine otherwise"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.8,
      "end_seconds": 218.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.59,
      "end_seconds": 223.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "so so my son has asthma"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.09,
      "end_seconds": 228.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.87,
      "end_seconds": 232.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Asthma for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.04,
      "end_seconds": 239.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.53,
      "end_seconds": 251.75,
      "duration_seconds": 11.22,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I hardly move around during the day. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.63,
      "end_seconds": 255.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.86,
      "end_seconds": 260.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "no, I don't take any tablets"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.81,
      "end_seconds": 264.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.58,
      "end_seconds": 271.71,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "just a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.37,
      "end_seconds": 280.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.01,
      "end_seconds": 284.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "no, I've never reacted to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.15,
      "end_seconds": 290.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, it points towards gestational diabetes controllable with diet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.78,
      "end_seconds": 294.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "oh is this serious doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.61,
      "end_seconds": 304.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.56,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like gestational diabetes controllable with diet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.46,
      "end_seconds": 317.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "replace sugary drinks and white starches with wholegrains and walk after meals"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.71,
      "end_seconds": 321.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Yes. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.73,
      "end_seconds": 330.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Actually no that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
